                "region": {
                  "endLine": 88,
                  "startLine": 83
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "`GET /api/corpus/scan?path=<any absolute path>` takes an arbitrary operator filesystem path verbatim and returns a census of it \u2014 existence, enumerated file count, admitted-PDF count, total bytes, and a defect-keyed skip histogram. Its only control is a 503 raised when `run_monitor_root` is unwired. That marker proves the process was composed as the local launcher; it does not prove the CALLER is local. Any launcher bound to a routable address therefore exposes arbitrary directory enumeration to unauthenticated remote callers."
          },
